<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Corpgro says Chillers deal off.</title>
<headline>Corpgro says Chillers deal off.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corpgro Ltd said on Friday it would not proceed with a deal to buy a controlling interest in Chillers Group Ltd because an unspecified condition of the agreement had not been fulfilled.</p>
<p>The company first announced its plans to take control of Chillers on September 11.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
